{
  "info": {
    "name": "OPOX · Bloque 10 · Monitor BOE",
    "description": "Tests de humo para todos los endpoints del Bloque 10 (Monitor BOE).\n\n## Variables de colección\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:3000\n- `token`: JWT del usuario (se rellena en el paso de login)\n- `change_id`: UUID del cambio Art.14 seed (se fija automáticamente)\n\n## Orden de ejecución recomendado\n1. Auth · Login → captura token\n2. Temario · Listar temas → verifica array con los 10 temas de justicia-tramitacion\n3. BOE · Feed → verifica secciones y shape de items\n4. BOE · Detalle cambio (Art.14) → verifica shape BoeChangeDetail\n5. BOE · Comparativa (Art.14) → verifica fragmentos antes/después\n6. BOE · Mini-test genera (Art.14) → verifica preguntas con 3 opciones\n7. BOE · Marcar leído (Art.14) → verifica isRead:true\n8. BOE · Bookmark activar (Art.14) → verifica bookmarked:bool\n9. BOE · Bookmark quitar (Art.14) → verifica toggle inverso\n10. BOE · Completar mini-test (Art.14) → 204 No Content\n11. BOE · Detalle cambio tipográfico (Art.58) → verifica type mapping\n12-14. Casos de error → 401, 404, 400\n\n## Datos de seed\n- Norma: BOE-A-2015-10565 (Ley 39/2015)\n- Change Art.14: `00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000010`\n- Change Art.21: `00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000011`\n- Change Art.58: `00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000012`\n- Demo user: `5c4f377c-a6dc-4158-acd0-7310efda78c7` — reemplaza si usas otro.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "change_id",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000010"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.ok && res.data?.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", res.data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Token guardado\");",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error(\"❌ Login fallido\", res);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"santigarciavel33@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SantiGV@2005\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "⚠️ Rellena email y password con las credenciales de tu usuario de prueba en Supabase.\nEl userId debe ser el del seed (5c4f377c-a6dc-4158-acd0-7310efda78c7) para que aparezcan datos preexistentes."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · Temario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar temas — justicia-tramitacion",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ok = true', () => pm.expect(res.ok).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('devuelve array de temas', () => pm.expect(res.data).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('al menos 1 tema', () => pm.expect(res.data.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    const t = res.data[0];",
                  "    pm.test('cada tema tiene id y label', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(t).to.include.keys('id', 'label');",
                  "        pm.expect(t.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "        pm.expect(t.label).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "    console.log('Primer tema:', t.id, '-', t.label);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/training/topics?oposicion=justicia-tramitacion",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "training",
                "topics"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "oposicion",
                  "value": "justicia-tramitacion"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve los 10 temas del seed de justicia-tramitacion. El GeneratorConfigScreen usa este endpoint para poblar el picker de temario."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Feed BOE",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /boe/feed — secciones y shape de items",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ok = true', () => pm.expect(res.ok).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('devuelve sections[]', () => pm.expect(res.data.sections).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "const sections = res.data.sections;",
                  "if (sections.length > 0) {",
                  "    const section = sections[0];",
                  "    pm.test('seccion tiene sectionTitle + data[]', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(section).to.include.keys('sectionTitle', 'data');",
                  "        pm.expect(section.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    });",
                  "    if (section.data.length > 0) {",
                  "        const item = section.data[0];",
                  "        pm.test('item tiene shape completo', () => {",
                  "            pm.expect(item).to.include.keys(",
                  "                'id', 'boeIdentifier', 'regulationTitle', 'shortTitle',",
                  "                'articulo', 'changeType', 'affectedQuestionsCount',",
                  "                'detectedAt', 'isRead', 'isBookmarked'",
                  "            );",
                  "        });",
                  "        pm.test('changeType es valido', () => {",
                  "            pm.expect(['modificacion','derogacion','nueva','tipografica']).to.include(item.changeType);",
                  "        });",
                  "        pm.test('isRead y isBookmarked son boolean', () => {",
                  "            pm.expect(item.isRead).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "            pm.expect(item.isBookmarked).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "        });",
                  "        console.log('Feed primer item:', item.articulo, '|', item.changeType, '| read:', item.isRead);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/boe/feed",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "boe",
                "feed"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Agrupa los cambios de las normas seguidas por el usuario en secciones ('Esta semana' / 'Anterior') y añade isRead/isBookmarked por usuario."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
